#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:13
msgid ""
"Konya helps you navigate social policy documents—step by step, in plain "
"language, against the rules you bring."
msgstr ""
"Konya inakusaidia kusafiri hati za sera za kijamii—hatua kwa hatua, kwa "
"lugha rahisi, dhidi ya sheria unazotoa."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:19
msgid "What Konya does"
msgstr "Konya inafanya nini"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:21
msgid ""
"Reads the official policy link or PDF you provide (Bring Your Own Policy)."
msgstr ""
"Inasoma kiungo au PDF rasmi cha sera unachotoa (Leta Sera Yako Mwenyewe)."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:22
msgid "Compares your situation to that document’s eligibility rules."
msgstr "Inalinganisha hali yako na sheria za ustahiki za hati hiyo."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:23
msgid "Asks focused questions until the requirements are clear."
msgstr "Inauliza maswali mahususi hadi mahitaji yawe wazi."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:24
msgid ""
"Issues an Action Blueprint—what you may need, what to prepare, and suggested "
"next steps."
msgstr ""
"Inatoa Mpango wa Hatua—kile unachohitaji, cha kuandaa, na hatua "
"zinazopendekezwa."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:25
msgid "Answers follow-up questions strictly grounded in your uploaded policy."
msgstr "Inajibu maswali ya ufuatiliaji kulingana na sera uliyopakia."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:30
msgid "What Konya does not do"
msgstr "Konya haifanyi nini"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:32
msgid "Submit applications, forms, or paperwork on your behalf."
msgstr "Kutuma maombi, fomu, au nyaraka kwa niaba yako."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:33
msgid "Grant approvals, benefits, or official eligibility decisions."
msgstr "Kutoa idhini, faida, au maamuzi rasmi ya ustahiki."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:34
msgid "Replace advice from a government office, legal adviser, or caseworker."
msgstr ""
"Kuchukua nafasi ya ushauri kutoka ofisi ya serikali, mshauri wa kisheria, au "
"mfanyakazi wa kesi."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:35
msgid "Guarantee outcomes—guidance is informational only."
msgstr "Kuhakikisha matokeo—mwelekezo ni wa taarifa tu."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:36
msgid ""
"Navigate without a policy document you supply; it does not invent program "
"rules."
msgstr "Kusafiri bila hati ya sera unayotoa; haijui sheria za programu."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:41
msgid "Your responsibility"
msgstr "Wajibu wako"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\about.html:43
msgid ""
"Always verify Konya’s guidance against the official policy and confirm next "
"steps with the relevant authority before you act. Submit your application "
"directly to the program or office that runs it."
msgstr ""
"Thibitisha daima mwelekezo wa Konya dhidi ya sera rasmi na hakikisha hatua "
"zinazofuata na mamlaka husika kabla ya kutenda. Wasilisha ombi lako moja kwa "
"moja kwa programu au ofisi inayoendesha."

