#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\privacy.html:11
#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\terms.html:11
msgid "Last updated: June 2026 · Placeholder for MVP testing"
msgstr "Ilisasishwa mwisho: Juni 2026 · Kishikilia nafasi kwa majaribio ya MVP"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\privacy.html:16
msgid ""
"This privacy policy is a placeholder for the Konya MVP test environment. It "
"describes our intended approach in plain language and will be replaced "
"before a public launch."
msgstr ""
"Sera hii ya faragha ni kishikilia nafasi kwa mazingira ya majaribio ya MVP "
"ya Konya. Inaelezea mbinu yetu kwa lugha rahisi na itabadilishwa kabla ya "
"kuzinduliwa kwa umma."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\privacy.html:19
msgid ""
"During testing, we may store account details, conversation history, and "
"policy documents you provide solely to operate and improve the navigation "
"experience. Use placeholder credentials and non-sensitive sample data "
"whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"Wakati wa majaribio, tunaweza kuhifadhi maelezo ya akaunti, historia ya "
"mazungumzo, na hati za sera unazotoa ili kuendesha na kuboresha uzoefu wa "
"usafiri. Tumia taarifa za majaribio na data ya sampuli isiyo nyeti kila "
"inapowezekana."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\privacy.html:22
msgid ""
"We do not sell personal information. If you have questions about data use in "
"this test phase, contact the project team running your evaluation session."
msgstr ""
"Hatuuzi taarifa za kibinafsi. Ikiwa una maswali kuhusu matumizi ya data "
"katika awamu hii ya majaribio, wasiliana na timu ya mradi inayoendesha "
"kipindi chako cha tathmini."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\privacy.html:27
#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\terms.html:27
msgid "Back to registration"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye usajili"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\terms.html:16
msgid ""
"Konya is provided as a test environment to help you explore policy "
"navigation workflows. These terms are a placeholder and do not constitute a "
"binding agreement."
msgstr ""
"Konya inatolewa kama mazingira ya majaribio ili kukusaidia kuchunguza "
"mtiririko wa usafiri wa sera. Masharti haya ni kishikilia nafasi na hayaundi "
"makubaliano ya kulazimisha."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\terms.html:19
msgid ""
"By using this service during the MVP phase, you acknowledge that features, "
"data handling, and availability may change without notice. Do not submit "
"sensitive personal information or rely on outputs as official legal or "
"eligibility advice."
msgstr ""
"Kwa kutumia huduma hii wakati wa awamu ya MVP, unakubali kuwa vipengele, "
"ushughulikaji wa data, na upatikanaji vinaweza kubadilika bila taarifa. "
"Usiweke taarifa nyeti za kibinafsi wala usitegemee matokeo kama ushauri "
"rasmi wa kisheria au ustahiki."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\legal\terms.html:22
msgid ""
"You are responsible for verifying any guidance against official program "
"documentation and contacting the relevant authority before taking action."
msgstr ""
"Una wajibu wa kuthibitisha mwelekezo wowote dhidi ya nyaraka rasmi za "
"programu na kuwasiliana na mamlaka husika kabla ya kuchukua hatua."

