msgid "Skip Intro"
msgstr "Ruka Utangulizi"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:91
msgid "Step 1 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua ya 1 kati ya 3"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:93
msgid "What is Konya?"
msgstr "Konya ni nini?"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:96
msgid ""
"Konya is a social policy navigator. You bring the official policy link or "
"PDF for your case—we read it against your situation, ask focused questions, "
"and issue an Action Blueprint with what to prepare and suggested next steps."
msgstr ""
"Konya ni mwelekezi wa sera za kijamii. Unaleta kiungo au PDF rasmi cha sera "
"inayohusiana na hali yako—tunaisoma dhidi ya hali yako, kuuliza maswali "
"mahususi, na kutoa Mpango wa Hatua wenye maandalizi na hatua "
"zinazopendekezwa."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:99
msgid ""
"Konya does not submit applications, grant benefits, or replace advice from a "
"government office. Guidance is informational and grounded in the document "
"you provide."
msgstr ""
"Konya haitumii maombi, haitoi faida, wala haichukui nafasi ya ushauri kutoka "
"ofisi ya serikali. Mwelekezo ni wa taarifa tu na unategemea hati unayotoa."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:103
#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:10
msgid "Test environment"
msgstr "Mazingira ya majaribio"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:105
msgid ""
"This is an MVP preview—not production. Use placeholder emails and passwords "
"if you register; accounts exist only for evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Hii ni onyesho la MVP—si toleo rasmi. Tumia barua pepe na nywila za "
"majaribio ukijisajili; akaunti zipo kwa tathmini tu."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:116
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Ifuatayo"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:127
msgid "Step 2 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua ya 2 kati ya 3"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:129
msgid "Select Language"
msgstr "Chagua Lugha"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:132
msgid ""
"Choose how you'd like Konya to communicate with you. You can change this "
"anytime from the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Chagua jinsi unavyotaka Konya iwasiliane nawe. Unaweza kubadilisha wakati "
"wowote kutoka kwenye upau wa pembeni."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:140
msgid "Select language"
msgstr "Chagua lugha"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:158
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Endelea"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:169
msgid "Step 3 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua ya 3 kati ya 3"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:171
msgid "How would you like to continue?"
msgstr "Ungependa kuendelea vipi?"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:174
msgid ""
"Create an account to save your navigations across devices, or continue as a "
"guest to try Konya now. Guest chats stay in this browser only."
msgstr ""
"Fungua akaunti ili kuhifadhi safari zako kwenye vifaa vyote, au endelea kama "
"mgeni kujaribu Konya sasa. Mazungumzo ya mgeni hubaki kwenye kivinjari hiki "
"tu."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:177
msgid ""
"Remember: this preview is for testing—use placeholder credentials if you "
"sign up."
msgstr ""
"Kumbuka: onyesho hili ni kwa majaribio—tumia taarifa za majaribio "
"ukijisajili."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:188
msgid "Create an Account"
msgstr "Fungua Akaunti"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\onboarding.html:199
msgid "Continue as Guest"
msgstr "Endelea kama Mgeni"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:4
#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:78
msgid "Create account"
msgstr "Fungua akaunti"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:12
msgid ""
"Use a placeholder email and password. Accounts here are for MVP evaluation "
"only—not real sign-ups."
msgstr ""
"Tumia barua pepe na nywila za majaribio. Akaunti hapa ni kwa tathmini ya MVP "
"tu—si usajili halisi."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:17
msgid "Create your account"
msgstr "Fungua akaunti yako"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:18
msgid "Start navigating with a clean, persistent history."
msgstr "Anza kusafiri na historia safi na ya kudumu."

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:58
msgid "Create a password"
msgstr "Unda nywila"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:68
msgid "By registering, you agree to our"
msgstr "Kwa kujisajili, unakubali"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:70
msgid "and"
msgstr "na"

#: .\navigator\templates\navigator\signup.html:83
msgid "Already have an account?"
msgstr "Tayari una akaunti?"

#: .\navigator\views.py:761
msgid "Invalid email or password."
msgstr "Barua pepe au nywila si sahihi."

